From 4d79bd71ff73d5d0a3d56f16f1fd534023f67e8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wmehanna <wassimmehanna@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:43:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(vmapple): patch IOSurface createFence for any known
 macOS 27 build

P79: the guest's IOSurface fence code is patched per queue. The matcher
(iofence-match.c, no QEMU dependencies so it is testable offline)
finds createIOFence by shape (word 2 and the masked BL distance),
validates the decoded constants and requires the SHA-256 of the 64 KiB
kext text to be a row of a small per-build table (26A428, 26B131).
Unknown shapes are refused and logged with the values for a new row.
Rescans when the kext text is in RAM twice.
---
